§E  THE FINDING, STATED
  His isTotal accepts a branch body on `occ(b.mask, 'cls =') > 0` — containment of a TOKEN,
  at any depth, under any condition. His own cripple C2 reddens because it DELETES that token,
  not because the body stopped always-assigning. So C2 grades the token, not the property, and
  cure N — strictly weaker than C2, same branch — is TOTAL by his walker with p=3.
  And in the other direction, three class literals are reached 0 times, so a rename out of the
  ten orphans nothing: the static check is neither sufficient nor necessary. The exact carrier
  is L_reached ⊆ CLASSES, and that one needs the corpus.

